WEBVTT

00:13.340 --> 00:16.680
<b><i>He is Ranma of the Saotome School</i>
<i>of Anything Goes Martial Arts.</i></b>

00:20.310 --> 00:22.980
<b><i>And Ranma has a problem.</i></b>

00:26.520 --> 00:29.980
<b><i>He transforms into a girl</i>
<i>when he's splashed with water.</i></b>

00:35.280 --> 00:39.530
<b>RANMA1/2</b>

02:01.570 --> 02:03.540
<b>HOT COMPETITION</b>

02:03.620 --> 02:07.460
<b>Bare-handed attacks aren't allowed
in Martial Arts Rhythmic Gymnastics.</b>

02:08.040 --> 02:09.710
<b>Tomorrow is the day of the match.</b>

02:09.790 --> 02:13.420
<b>Practice is the only way
to master all the techniques.</b>

02:14.920 --> 02:16.170
<b>Are you ready?</b>

02:16.760 --> 02:19.930
<b>Ready when you are. Bring it on!</b>

02:20.010 --> 02:21.510
<b>Come at me from any--</b>

02:25.390 --> 02:26.390
<b>Too easy--</b>

02:26.980 --> 02:29.690
<b>Use your tools. Are you an animal?</b>

02:31.480 --> 02:33.310
<b>Pesky little things.</b>

02:34.320 --> 02:36.070
<b>Okay, let's get this rolling.</b>

03:03.050 --> 03:04.720
<b>WORM - DOG</b>

03:04.800 --> 03:06.470
<b>TWERP - LOSER</b>

03:08.220 --> 03:09.850
<b>You've got a knack for this, Ranma.</b>

03:10.690 --> 03:11.940
<b>Right?</b>

03:12.020 --> 03:14.270
<b>I wasn't dillydallying here
this past week--</b>

03:18.110 --> 03:19.150
<b>Keep it comin'.</b>

03:19.650 --> 03:21.070
<b>Are you okay, Ranma?</b>

03:21.570 --> 03:22.950
<b>Go to bed.</b>

03:23.030 --> 03:24.370
<b>I can't do that.</b>

03:24.870 --> 03:27.580
<b>What, are you worried about me?</b>

03:27.660 --> 03:29.830
<b>No, it's not like that.</b>

03:31.870 --> 03:33.460
<b>Don't worry, and get your rest.</b>

03:33.960 --> 03:36.920
<b>I'll make sure he learns
all sorts of special attacks.</b>

03:37.500 --> 03:38.550
<b>Yeah?</b>

03:41.220 --> 03:44.550
<b>If they keep at it like that,
then this game is already in the bag.</b>

03:46.800 --> 03:48.680
<b>P-chan? Where'd he go?</b>

03:50.600 --> 03:52.350
<b>This is just something I overheard.</b>

03:53.230 --> 03:54.730
<b>If you lose tomorrow's match,</b>

03:55.730 --> 04:00.280
<b>you promised to go out with
a girl named Kodachi, the Black Rose.</b>

04:01.740 --> 04:02.740
<b>You bet I did.</b>

04:03.740 --> 04:07.660
<b>In other words, you and Akane
will become complete strangers.</b>

04:08.280 --> 04:10.910
<b>You are going to lose
tomorrow's match for me, Ranma!</b>

04:12.660 --> 04:17.340
<b>I thought it was fishy. You'd never agree
to coach me out of the blue like this.</b>

04:17.420 --> 04:21.710
<b>Sorry, but I have no intentions
of dating that woman.</b>

04:23.090 --> 04:26.890
<b>I'll cripple you
long before the match begins!</b>

04:26.970 --> 04:29.720
<b>Oh, yeah? I'd like to see you try!</b>

04:29.810 --> 04:31.680
<b>-Take this!
-Booyah!</b>

04:54.460 --> 04:55.790
<b>I slept so well.</b>

04:56.460 --> 04:57.830
<b>What a nice day.</b>

05:07.050 --> 05:08.470
<b>Hey, you two--</b>

05:09.050 --> 05:10.050
<b>What the…</b>

05:10.140 --> 05:12.020
<b>Come on! Fold!</b>

05:12.640 --> 05:14.060
<b>Never!</b>

05:14.890 --> 05:17.100
<b>Tell me you didn't pull an all-nighter.</b>

05:18.650 --> 05:19.980
<b>Is it morning already?</b>

05:23.900 --> 05:26.280
<b>Hey, are you sure you've got this?</b>

05:29.030 --> 05:32.240
<b>I'm fine. I really am.</b>

05:33.290 --> 05:34.950
<b>I'm fine.</b>

05:35.460 --> 05:36.710
<b>Kasumi.</b>

05:39.170 --> 05:41.000
<b>This fish cake is hard.</b>

05:41.590 --> 05:43.920
<b>-That's a hand towel.
-Ooh.</b>

05:44.010 --> 05:45.510
<b><i>This guy…</i></b>

05:49.680 --> 05:51.470
<b><i>There will be</i></b>

05:51.550 --> 05:55.390
<b><i>a Martial Arts Rhythmic Gymnastics</i>
<i>interschool match at 1:00 p.m. today.</i></b>

05:56.180 --> 05:57.690
<b>A stand-in gymnast?</b>

05:57.770 --> 06:00.230
<b>That's right. You see, I have an injury.</b>

06:00.770 --> 06:02.190
<b>She's my replacement.</b>

06:02.730 --> 06:05.110
<b>The girl with the pigtail.</b>

06:05.190 --> 06:07.070
<b>We've met once, yes?</b>

06:07.740 --> 06:08.990
<b>Very well.</b>

06:09.990 --> 06:11.990
<b>Let's both strive to do our best.</b>

06:14.660 --> 06:18.000
<b>What's this? How did these tacks
get between my fingers?</b>

06:18.870 --> 06:20.710
<b>FURINKAN HIGH SCHOOL</b>

06:20.790 --> 06:21.790
<b>This is our room.</b>

06:25.710 --> 06:26.710
<b>Watch out!</b>

06:30.800 --> 06:32.600
<b>Gotta keep our guard up.</b>

06:36.850 --> 06:38.140
<b>I'm wide awake now.</b>

06:40.690 --> 06:42.860
<b>GOOD LUCK
FROM THE BLACK ROSE</b>

06:52.820 --> 06:53.990
<b>Sedative.</b>

06:58.790 --> 07:01.290
<b>This is St. Bacchus' School for Girls,
right?</b>

07:01.370 --> 07:03.170
<b>No mistaking it?</b>

07:03.250 --> 07:04.460
<b>Yes.</b>

07:04.960 --> 07:07.000
<b>I made it without getting lost.</b>

07:07.960 --> 07:10.590
<b>-What's his deal?
-Beats me.</b>

07:10.680 --> 07:15.100
<b><i>In spite of my abysmal sense of direction,</i>
<i>I got here on my first try.</i></b>

07:16.260 --> 07:18.680
<b><i>This is the power of love, Akane!</i></b>

07:22.060 --> 07:24.190
<b>This is not the time to be emotional.</b>

07:24.690 --> 07:27.480
<b>I've got to sabotage Ranma's match--</b>

07:28.480 --> 07:30.900
<b>Hey, someone could be down there.</b>

07:31.450 --> 07:33.610
<b>It's fine. There's only a pig.</b>

07:38.080 --> 07:41.290
<b>I've done all I could,
but the finishing blow is still lacking.</b>

07:42.000 --> 07:44.420
<b>I will win and claim my Ranma as mine.</b>

07:46.750 --> 07:47.840
<b>Look at it!</b>

07:49.460 --> 07:50.800
<b>It's adorable.</b>

07:50.880 --> 07:52.010
<b>Let me hold it next.</b>

07:52.090 --> 07:54.300
<b>Where did this little piggy come from?</b>

07:56.050 --> 07:57.390
<b>Kodachi, it's you.</b>

07:58.640 --> 08:01.140
<b>This piggy is going to give me a hand.</b>

08:06.610 --> 08:09.360
<b>To the ten million Martial Arts
Rhythmic Gymnastics fans across Japan,</b>

08:09.440 --> 08:11.110
<b>the long-awaited time is here.</b>

08:11.190 --> 08:14.700
<b>The Martial Arts Rhythmic Gymnastics match
to settle the score</b>

08:14.780 --> 08:18.490
<b>between Furinkan High School and
St. Bacchus' School for Girls starts now.</b>

08:19.450 --> 08:22.080
<b>Direct your eyes
toward the entrance ramps.</b>

08:22.580 --> 08:24.750
<b>These fighters
will represent their schools.</b>

08:25.330 --> 08:28.340
<b>Kodachi Kuno, basked in light,
emerges into the arena.</b>

08:28.420 --> 08:31.260
<b>She's like a war goddess with a halo.</b>

08:31.840 --> 08:34.260
<b>The fighter from Furinkan High
is also here.</b>

08:34.340 --> 08:37.600
<b>Taking one step at a time
is a mysterious and beautiful girl</b>

08:37.680 --> 08:39.720
<b>who is standing in for the injured gymnast</b>

08:39.810 --> 08:42.230
<b>-<i>from Furinkan High School.</i>
-<i>Kodachi!</i></b>

08:42.310 --> 08:44.520
<b><i>The crowd chants for Kodachi.</i></b>

08:44.600 --> 08:46.730
<b><i>Show us your spirit for this game.</i></b>

08:47.610 --> 08:49.770
<b>The mysterious girl keeps her silence.</b>

08:49.860 --> 08:51.940
<b>She's fully focused
to win this away match.</b>

08:52.030 --> 08:54.860
<b>This will be one thrilling ride!</b>

08:54.950 --> 08:57.240
<b>Kodachi!</b>

08:58.070 --> 08:59.450
<b>If it isn't Tatewaki.</b>

08:59.530 --> 09:00.950
<b>Hello, Kodachi.</b>

09:01.040 --> 09:04.540
<b>-Kodachi's older brother is handsome.
-What a heartthrob.</b>

09:04.620 --> 09:07.920
<b>You hear that? Ignorance is bliss.</b>

09:08.500 --> 09:09.590
<b>Seriously.</b>

09:11.800 --> 09:12.920
<b>In the Red Corner…</b>

09:15.590 --> 09:18.340
<b>Kodachi Kuno!</b>

09:19.760 --> 09:21.390
<b>Kodachi!</b>

09:21.470 --> 09:22.720
<b>In the Blue Corner…</b>

09:24.480 --> 09:26.480
<b>Pardon me, what do you go by?</b>

09:26.980 --> 09:28.100
<b>Ranma Saotome.</b>

09:28.190 --> 09:30.820
<b>Is it smart to use your real name?</b>

09:30.900 --> 09:33.320
<b>Yeah, I'm not worried about it.</b>

09:34.030 --> 09:36.320
<b>Representing Furinkan High School…</b>

09:40.950 --> 09:43.870
<b>Ranma Saotome!</b>

09:44.870 --> 09:46.580
<b>Ranma Saotome?</b>

09:46.660 --> 09:48.750
<b>It's the pigtailed girl.</b>

09:48.830 --> 09:50.250
<b>Ranma Saotome, she said.</b>

09:50.330 --> 09:51.500
<b>Ranma?</b>

09:51.590 --> 09:52.920
<b>Do they have the same name?</b>

09:56.970 --> 10:00.140
<b>That girl's name is also Ranma Saotome?</b>

10:00.220 --> 10:05.100
<b>When it's for a girl, that name is
very, very, very annoying.</b>

10:06.310 --> 10:08.020
<b>So that's her name!</b>

10:08.100 --> 10:10.190
<b>Better write it down before I forget.</b>

10:10.270 --> 10:14.280
<b>I guess it's possible for two people
to have the same name.</b>

10:14.780 --> 10:17.610
<b>She even reminds me of Ranma.</b>

10:18.320 --> 10:20.570
<b>Two people can look alike by coincidence.</b>

10:21.280 --> 10:22.700
<b>-See?
-Oh, boy.</b>

10:23.620 --> 10:25.660
<b>Fighters, meet at the center of the ring.</b>

10:27.960 --> 10:29.580
<b>Now please shake hands.</b>

10:33.460 --> 10:35.300
<b>-Look over there!
-What's that?</b>

10:38.050 --> 10:39.970
<b>Don't ever drop your guard.</b>

10:45.510 --> 10:46.720
<b>P-chan?</b>

10:50.270 --> 10:52.270
<b>You're hell-bent on getting in my way.</b>

10:57.440 --> 10:59.450
<b>Ryoga, you little…</b>

11:03.320 --> 11:07.910
<b>The clear ring of the gong is drowned
in the roaring cheer of the crowd.</b>

11:08.000 --> 11:11.670
<b>Martial Arts Rhythmic Gymnastics,
one round, infinite duration, now begins.</b>

11:11.750 --> 11:13.670
<b>The commentary is brought to you</b>

11:13.750 --> 11:18.170
<b><i>by yours truly, Ichiro</i>
<i>of Furinkan High School's Broadcast Club.</i></b>

11:19.130 --> 11:20.420
<b>Furinkan Broadcast Club?</b>

11:20.510 --> 11:22.260
<b>It's always these guys.</b>

11:22.760 --> 11:25.430
<b>Bare-handed attacks
are prohibited in this match.</b>

11:25.510 --> 11:28.600
<b>The match doesn't end
until a fighter is completely KO'd.</b>

11:29.100 --> 11:33.350
<b>One more, the rule states, whoever falls
off the ring is immediately disqualified.</b>

11:33.440 --> 11:36.400
<b>Hey, Ryoga.
Cause me trouble and I'll beat you up.</b>

11:37.020 --> 11:39.940
<b><i>I don't enjoy beating up women.</i></b>

11:40.030 --> 11:43.490
<b>I'll boot you off the ring
before you get scratched up!</b>

11:46.530 --> 11:48.540
<b>How kind of you.</b>

11:48.620 --> 11:50.330
<b>What an excellent rope maneuver.</b>

11:50.410 --> 11:53.750
<b>Just as expected from Kodachi, the flower
of Martial Arts Rhythmic Gymnastics!</b>

11:57.170 --> 12:00.130
<b>What's this? It was a rod!</b>

12:00.210 --> 12:02.220
<b>It was a rod disguised as rope!</b>

12:02.300 --> 12:04.180
<b>She's cheating, referee!</b>

12:04.260 --> 12:06.100
<b>She's using a tool. No penalty!</b>

12:07.810 --> 12:09.640
<b>Kodachi swaps out for the clubs.</b>

12:09.720 --> 12:12.690
<b>She unleashes a flurry of strikes!</b>

12:13.940 --> 12:16.310
<b>Spikes came out of the tip of the club!</b>

12:18.230 --> 12:19.780
<b>I don't see any spikes.</b>

12:20.570 --> 12:24.070
<b>It's a custom-made club that turns spiky
with the push of a button.</b>

12:24.910 --> 12:27.780
<b>Though she's my sister,
she's a master at playing dirty.</b>

12:28.450 --> 12:31.750
<b>This is all for courting my Ranma Saotome.</b>

12:32.710 --> 12:35.790
<b>I think my methods are quite admirable.</b>

12:35.880 --> 12:37.210
<b>You're talking crazy!</b>

12:37.290 --> 12:40.250
<b>I keep telling you, I have no plans</b>

12:40.840 --> 12:42.630
<b>of dating you!</b>

12:45.220 --> 12:46.890
<b>-Pig is allowed!
-Pig is allowed!</b>

12:46.970 --> 12:50.720
<b>Ranma Saotome deals a skillful pig blow!</b>

12:50.810 --> 12:52.730
<b>The pig counts as a tool.</b>

12:52.810 --> 12:54.350
<b>One, two.</b>

12:54.440 --> 12:57.730
<b>Who said anything
about going out with you?</b>

12:57.810 --> 12:59.150
<b>Anyhow,</b>

12:59.230 --> 13:03.190
<b>if you lose, promise me you'll never
appear in front of Ranma Saotome again.</b>

13:05.450 --> 13:08.820
<b>You… What are you to my Ranma?</b>

13:08.910 --> 13:11.200
<b>Do you agree or not?</b>

13:13.120 --> 13:14.330
<b>What's with you?</b>

13:14.410 --> 13:17.540
<b>I know. You're smitten by my Ranma.</b>

13:17.630 --> 13:20.040
<b>Now it's crystal clear.
That's why you interfere.</b>

13:20.130 --> 13:21.800
<b>What a sly woman you are.</b>

13:21.880 --> 13:23.840
<b>Take this, you! There!</b>

13:25.300 --> 13:27.050
<b>He's not into dating you!</b>

13:28.140 --> 13:30.350
<b>Your lie is too easy to expose.</b>

13:30.890 --> 13:32.390
<b>-Hoop.
-Here!</b>

13:33.220 --> 13:36.060
<b>You aren't worthy of
speaking my Ranma's name.</b>

13:36.140 --> 13:38.650
<b>I, Kodachi, the Black Rose,
will vanquish you.</b>

13:38.730 --> 13:39.860
<b>The hoop flies!</b>

13:41.190 --> 13:42.360
<b>Razor blade?</b>

13:45.400 --> 13:48.240
<b>You love to see it!
She dodged the chasing ribbon.</b>

13:50.780 --> 13:52.830
<b>But the War Goddess is relentless.</b>

13:53.410 --> 13:57.710
<b>Ranma evades with a stack jump,
a deer jump and a split leg jump.</b>

13:57.790 --> 13:59.210
<b>A heated offense and defense!</b>

13:59.290 --> 14:00.290
<b>Ranma!</b>

14:02.090 --> 14:04.260
<b>If words don't work,</b>

14:04.840 --> 14:07.130
<b>then you'll just have to go down!</b>

14:07.720 --> 14:08.840
<b>That's skill.</b>

14:08.930 --> 14:10.640
<b>She's handling poles like nunchaku.</b>

14:11.550 --> 14:12.930
<b>You make me laugh.</b>

14:13.430 --> 14:17.100
<b>Kodachi, the Black Rose, Martial Arts
Rhythmic Gymnastics Special Attack.</b>

14:17.180 --> 14:21.230
<b>Thousand-Armed Club Attack!</b>

14:21.310 --> 14:23.770
<b>The War Goddess prevails.
She's been with us all along!</b>

14:23.860 --> 14:25.730
<b>It's the Thousand-Armed Kannon!</b>

14:25.820 --> 14:28.030
<b>In her hands, a single club
appears to be a dozen or two!</b>

14:28.110 --> 14:29.110
<b>Ranma!</b>

14:31.490 --> 14:33.280
<b>Attack!</b>

14:40.080 --> 14:42.130
<b>Unbelievable performance from Kodachi!</b>

14:42.210 --> 14:46.210
<b>She was actually handling
dozens of clubs at once!</b>

14:46.300 --> 14:48.130
<b>It's beyond dirty! This is amazing!</b>

14:48.220 --> 14:49.720
<b>I've got more in store.</b>

14:49.800 --> 14:53.600
<b>The heart of Martial Arts Rhythmic
Gymnastics is its infinite use of tools!</b>

15:00.480 --> 15:01.480
<b>-Watch out!
-Oh, crap.</b>

15:01.560 --> 15:03.310
<b>A deadly weapon attack using the bell.</b>

15:03.400 --> 15:05.480
<b>Ranma parries with a pig!</b>

15:05.980 --> 15:07.900
<b>The pig is oinking.</b>

15:07.990 --> 15:11.110
<b>Perhaps it's saying,
"How dare you use me as a shield."</b>

15:11.990 --> 15:13.240
<b>What else can I do?</b>

15:14.830 --> 15:16.290
<b>-You're wide open!
-Close one.</b>

15:16.370 --> 15:18.200
<b>I've got one for you too!</b>

15:18.790 --> 15:20.040
<b>Eat this!</b>

15:20.120 --> 15:23.040
<b>She reels in a whole desk!</b>

15:23.130 --> 15:24.210
<b>Majestic, yet reckless!</b>

15:24.290 --> 15:28.380
<b>The desk dances in the air as if a Tosa
angler catching a bonito with one line!</b>

15:32.260 --> 15:35.550
<b>As a response, Kodachi hauls her brother!</b>

15:35.640 --> 15:37.430
<b>Thrust!</b>

15:37.930 --> 15:40.940
<b>The biological brother,
of course, counts as a tool!</b>

15:41.440 --> 15:42.980
<b>Biological brother, allowed!</b>

15:43.060 --> 15:44.060
<b>-Allowed!
-Allowed!</b>

15:46.520 --> 15:49.030
<b>This is hell with no rules to uphold!</b>

15:49.110 --> 15:52.150
<b>No, it's a battle wonderland!</b>

15:54.740 --> 15:56.120
<b>Mr. Saotome.</b>

15:57.530 --> 16:00.500
<b>This is not the time to be sipping tea.</b>

16:02.370 --> 16:04.920
<b>I admit, you are one tenacious woman.</b>

16:05.500 --> 16:07.420
<b>Against a stubborn fighter like you…</b>

16:11.720 --> 16:14.640
<b>Water so scalding hot,
even roaches skitter out of the way!</b>

16:16.140 --> 16:19.310
<b>-Even Ranma retreats to the corner.
-Hot! No, no, no!</b>

16:19.390 --> 16:21.560
<b>It's only natural
to evade hot water after all!</b>

16:24.810 --> 16:26.860
<b>Not fond of hot water, are you?</b>

16:26.940 --> 16:29.440
<b><i>If I turn back to a man dressed like this…</i></b>

16:29.530 --> 16:31.030
<b>No way I'm getting splashed!</b>

16:31.110 --> 16:34.410
<b>Ranma finds escape in the air,
but Kodachi is relentless.</b>

16:34.490 --> 16:35.740
<b>Try harder!</b>

16:35.820 --> 16:37.910
<b>Hot!</b>

16:37.990 --> 16:39.740
<b>UH-OH!</b>

16:39.830 --> 16:44.830
<b>Oh, no! Ranma took a direct hit
from the hot water attack!</b>

16:46.540 --> 16:47.540
<b>What's this?</b>

16:48.130 --> 16:50.750
<b>In the steam… I see two… Two people!</b>

16:52.010 --> 16:54.260
<b>You look great, Ranma.</b>

16:54.340 --> 16:57.550
<b>You're the one who's stark naked, dumbass!</b>

16:58.050 --> 16:59.510
<b>That's cold!</b>

16:59.600 --> 17:03.600
<b>What's this? Ranma's second
brought out the fire hose.</b>

17:05.440 --> 17:07.440
<b>Good, it's just the girl and the pig.</b>

17:07.520 --> 17:09.650
<b>I must have been seeing things.</b>

17:12.690 --> 17:13.690
<b>Close call.</b>

17:15.110 --> 17:16.110
<b>Watch out!</b>

17:16.200 --> 17:18.070
<b>She's about to get pushed out of the ring!</b>

17:18.160 --> 17:21.240
<b>The moment her foot touches the ground,
she will be disqualified!</b>

17:21.330 --> 17:23.620
<b>Is this the end for Ranma?</b>

17:24.120 --> 17:27.040
<b>What on earth! Look at her go.</b>

17:27.120 --> 17:29.040
<b>Ranma swims to the center of the ring.</b>

17:29.130 --> 17:32.050
<b>Her determination to win
is beyond common sense!</b>

17:32.130 --> 17:34.300
<b>Borrowing your second's hand?</b>

17:34.380 --> 17:35.670
<b>You cheater!</b>

17:41.220 --> 17:42.930
<b>Stop your hopeless struggle.</b>

17:43.430 --> 17:46.390
<b>You want to steal my Ranma that badly?</b>

17:46.890 --> 17:49.650
<b>Hey, when did he become yours?</b>

17:49.730 --> 17:51.320
<b>Arguing is fruitless. There!</b>

17:51.400 --> 17:54.820
<b>I'm done with you. Get out of the ring!</b>

17:56.030 --> 17:57.320
<b>You hate to see it!</b>

17:57.400 --> 18:00.620
<b>Is it Kodachi's turn
to get hurled out of the ring?</b>

18:10.790 --> 18:13.300
<b>The ring is moving!</b>

18:16.720 --> 18:19.590
<b>You can't force me out of this ring.</b>

18:23.010 --> 18:24.770
<b>There you have it!</b>

18:25.970 --> 18:29.810
<b>Good golly! It was manpower
behind the moving ring!</b>

18:30.400 --> 18:33.770
<b>Members of St. Bacchus' School for Girls
Martial Arts Rhythmic Gymnastics</b>

18:33.860 --> 18:35.530
<b>quietly exit the ring.</b>

18:36.030 --> 18:38.240
<b>Well, now that the mat has been torn away,</b>

18:38.320 --> 18:41.320
<b>only the rope and the corner posts remain.</b>

18:41.410 --> 18:43.160
<b>First to fall off loses.</b>

18:43.660 --> 18:46.910
<b><i>Aerial combat is the basics of Saotome</i>
<i>School of Anything Goes Martial Arts.</i></b>

18:47.410 --> 18:49.250
<b>Let's end this!</b>

18:49.330 --> 18:50.790
<b>Insolent fool!</b>

18:53.250 --> 18:54.500
<b>Ryoga, you jerk!</b>

18:54.590 --> 18:56.210
<b>Razor blade hoop.</b>

18:58.800 --> 18:59.680
<b>Close one.</b>

19:07.220 --> 19:08.600
<b>Bastard.</b>

19:09.100 --> 19:12.980
<b>Ryoga, if you mess me up one more time,
I'll make mincemeat out of you.</b>

19:13.060 --> 19:16.530
<b>For some reason, Ranma is bullying
the pig. The pig is "picked on"!</b>

19:17.030 --> 19:20.780
<b>She should have paid attention!
Ranma has been caught!</b>

19:21.410 --> 19:23.910
<b>At this rate, she will plunge
into the dead center of the ring!</b>

19:25.870 --> 19:28.160
<b>No, Ranma has fight left in her.</b>

19:28.250 --> 19:30.410
<b>An astounding show of tenacity from Ranma!</b>

19:30.500 --> 19:32.120
<b>I'll use the momentum to kick you off!</b>

19:39.340 --> 19:41.760
<b>Like a pendulum,
Ranma swings to the other end.</b>

19:41.840 --> 19:43.760
<b>This is just pathetic.</b>

19:43.840 --> 19:44.850
<b>You're finished!</b>

19:46.720 --> 19:50.310
<b>Ranma uses the recoil of the rope.
Will she go for a body blow?</b>

19:51.850 --> 19:53.230
<b>What a fool.</b>

19:54.150 --> 19:56.770
<b>Attacks without tools are prohibited.</b>

19:59.570 --> 20:02.700
<b>There's a tool right below you!</b>

20:19.090 --> 20:22.130
<b>Kodachi Kuno, ringed out!</b>

20:22.220 --> 20:25.930
<b>Our winner is Ranma Saotome!</b>

20:33.890 --> 20:35.350
<b>I was totally defeated.</b>

20:37.310 --> 20:41.280
<b>As promised, I will let go</b>

20:42.240 --> 20:44.110
<b>of my love for my Ranma from today.</b>

20:48.120 --> 20:49.160
<b>Kodachi…</b>

20:58.090 --> 20:59.670
<b>I've made up my mind.</b>

21:00.300 --> 21:05.180
<b>From tomorrow, I, Kodachi, will burn
with my newfound love for my Ranma!</b>

21:09.390 --> 21:11.180
<b>My Ranma!</b>

21:11.270 --> 21:14.480
<b>Kodachi Kuno shows off
her undying fighting spirit!</b>

21:14.560 --> 21:18.440
<b>This is the way of life for a single
black rose that blooms in the ring.</b>

21:23.110 --> 21:24.280
<b>He burned out.</b>

22:56.910 --> 23:01.920
<b>Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter</b>
